  "description": "YITAMOTOR special design, same as original equipment in fit, performance, and function. You can get this Factory style headlight from YITAMOTOR for much less.\nFitment\n1999-2002 Chevy Silverado 1500 / 2500\n2001-2002 Chevy Silverado 1500HD / 2500HD / 3500HD\n2000-2006 Chevy Suburban 1500 / 2500\n2000-2006 Chevy Tahoe (NOT FIT 2000 Chevrolet Tahoe Z71 Model)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nBrighter & Wider Lighting\nThis upgraded headlight assembly adopts special meticulous chrome plating to increase the brightness and ultra-wide angle for better visibility in any dusky conditions to make your drive safer.\nWeather-Sealed\nThe fully sealed structure improves waterproof rating for effectively preventing moisture from entering the inside of headlights for longer service life.\nHigh-grade Housing Material\nThe superior lens features good transmission, high toughness, and excellent UV resistance to prevent yellowing & cracking; and the upgraded housing is shock-proof and heat-proof for ensuring better durability compared with other headlights.\nDirect Replacement\nProfessional Installation would be highly recommended. No extra gaps after installation for a perfect fit. Comes with a complete set of headlights, including Driver (Left) & Passenger (Right) sides.",
